1
00:00:07,633 --> 00:00:10,971
♪ Mokku, Mokku, Kashi no Ki Mokku! ♪
Mokku, Mokku, Mokku of the Oak Tree

2
00:00:10,995 --> 00:00:15,420
♪ Mokku, Mokku, Kashi no Ki Mokku! ♪
Mokku, Mokku, Mokku of the Oak Tree

3
00:00:17,362 --> 00:00:20,698
♪ Chisana boushi wo yokocho ni, Mokku! ♪
Wearing his little hat
tilted to the side, Mokku!

4
00:00:20,699 --> 00:00:26,899
♪ Yondara kubi dake kururi to, Mokku! ♪
When you call him, his head
spins right around, Mokku!

5
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:32,892
♪ Mokku ga waraeba minna mo warau ♪
When Mokku smiles, everyone smiles too

6
00:00:33,989 --> 00:00:36,480
♪ Hora hora koinu mo ♪
Look, look, even the puppy

7
00:00:37,244 --> 00:00:40,000
♪ kakete kuru ♪
comes running over

8
00:00:40,240 --> 00:00:43,483
♪ Piko piko pin pin, piko piko pin! ♪

9
00:00:43,508 --> 00:00:50,065
♪ Minna no Mokku, tanoshi Mokku! ♪
Everyone's Mokku, joyful Mokku!

10
00:00:50,396 --> 00:00:56,196
♪ Hora hora hora hora, Kashi no Ki Mokku! ♪
Look, look, look, look,
Mokku of the Oak Tree!

11
00:01:07,075 --> 00:01:10,069
♪ Piko piko pin pin, piko piko pin! ♪

12
00:01:10,264 --> 00:01:16,900
♪ Minna no Mokku, tanoshi Mokku! ♪
Everyone's Mokku, joyful Mokku!

13
00:01:17,030 --> 00:01:23,227
♪ Hora hora hora hora, Kashi no Ki Mokku! ♪
Look, look, look, look,
Mokku of the Oak Tree!

14
00:01:25,541 --> 00:01:30,799
Episode 01
I'm a Sad Wooden Puppet

15
00:02:21,160 --> 00:02:24,437
Huh? What does this old geezer
think he's doing to my home?

16
00:02:36,033 --> 00:02:37,889
Ow, that hurts.

17
00:02:40,811 --> 00:02:41,840
Yes, perfect, perfect.

18
00:02:52,440 --> 00:02:57,460
You truly are the ideal oak log
I could have ever wished for.

19
00:02:57,735 --> 00:03:00,640
I have been searching for
you for such a long time.

20
00:03:01,064 --> 00:03:03,780
Tch, as if an oak could
understand human words.

21
00:03:22,784 --> 00:03:25,593
Ah, looking good.

22
00:03:34,480 --> 00:03:37,495
Oh! It's done! It's done!
The wooden puppet is finished!

23
00:03:39,580 --> 00:03:44,600
You are my sweet grandchild.
I won't ever be lonely again.

24
00:03:44,725 --> 00:03:45,555
No!

25
00:03:45,580 --> 00:03:47,400
Look! Look!

26
00:03:50,530 --> 00:03:54,544
He's actually a kindhearted gee—
I mean, grandpa, after all.

27
00:03:55,337 --> 00:03:57,580
That's right, now you're a cute puppet!

28
00:03:57,605 --> 00:04:03,326
I've got to give you a name.
Let's see... Oak Tree, Oak, Oakie...

29
00:04:04,241 --> 00:04:06,044
Oakie?! Little Oakie!

30
00:04:06,080 --> 00:04:10,732
Wood, timber... Mokku... Mokku...

31
00:04:10,756 --> 00:04:13,725
That's it! Mokku's perfect! It's decided!

32
00:04:13,924 --> 00:04:16,552
Mokku? Yes, that's it!

33
00:04:17,215 --> 00:04:18,271
There now.

34
00:04:19,592 --> 00:04:21,519
Be a good, healthy boy.

35
00:04:21,891 --> 00:04:27,256
Oh, right. You're a wooden puppet.
You couldn't possibly understand me.

36
00:04:27,366 --> 00:04:34,340
But if only you could walk and
talk like a real human child...

37
00:04:34,705 --> 00:04:36,180
What foolishness!

38
00:04:36,520 --> 00:04:40,260
Forgive me, Mokku.
I'm asking for the impossible.

39
00:04:40,570 --> 00:04:42,719
Well, it's getting late.

40
00:04:44,670 --> 00:04:46,040
Good night, Mokku.

41
00:04:53,890 --> 00:04:56,264
Hey, Mokku. Let's be pals.

42
00:04:56,500 --> 00:04:58,620
After all, you used to be my home.

43
00:05:01,500 --> 00:05:03,658
Well, guess I'll turn in too, Mokku.

44
00:06:33,265 --> 00:06:37,365
Mokku, I am the Fairy of
your home, the Oak Tree.

45
00:06:37,616 --> 00:06:41,540
Grandfather's kind heart
made you into a puppet.

46
00:06:42,950 --> 00:06:47,757
I have heard Grandfather's wish,
and I have come to give you life.

47
00:06:48,945 --> 00:06:51,620
Mokku, you are a wooden puppet.

48
00:06:52,226 --> 00:06:52,802
But...

49
00:06:52,826 --> 00:06:56,646
...from now on, you will be able
to speak and move...

50
00:06:56,670 --> 00:06:58,380
...just like humans and animals.

51
00:06:59,160 --> 00:07:03,740
But you are still a wooden puppet.

52
00:07:05,175 --> 00:07:08,750
I can grant you no more power than that.

53
00:07:10,920 --> 00:07:14,663
Grant life to Mokku, the wooden puppet.

54
00:07:19,550 --> 00:07:21,580
Mokku, goodbye.

55
00:07:23,300 --> 00:07:24,780
Oh, she's vanishing.

56
00:07:44,248 --> 00:07:46,475
Could what the fairy said really be true?

57
00:07:47,397 --> 00:07:48,428
No way...

58
00:07:50,803 --> 00:07:51,838
Just my imagination?

59
00:08:08,240 --> 00:08:09,964
Whoa, he moved!

60
00:08:10,230 --> 00:08:12,642
Mokku, the wooden puppet, moved!

61
00:08:26,120 --> 00:08:27,120
There you go!

62
00:08:28,055 --> 00:08:29,760
Steady, steady, steady!

63
00:08:30,280 --> 00:08:31,881
You're doing great, Mokku!

64
00:08:32,440 --> 00:08:33,804
Who am I?

65
00:08:35,736 --> 00:08:37,874
Ooh! W-Wait! Hey, hey!

66
00:08:38,095 --> 00:08:39,740
Ow! Hey, that hurts, that hurts!

67
00:08:39,799 --> 00:08:40,946
H-Hey, let go!

68
00:08:41,020 --> 00:08:42,817
My body isn't made of wood like yours!

69
00:08:43,325 --> 00:08:45,750
Hey! I can't breathe! You're gonna kill me!

70
00:08:45,855 --> 00:08:47,380
Let go of me, Mokku!

71
00:08:47,585 --> 00:08:48,620
Mokku?

72
00:08:49,139 --> 00:08:50,659
That's your name!

73
00:08:51,079 --> 00:08:53,480
Right, you were just born,
so you don't know who you are yet.

74
00:08:53,765 --> 00:08:55,900
J-Just let go already!

75
00:09:12,509 --> 00:09:13,582
Serves you right!

76
00:09:18,479 --> 00:09:20,193
Look at you walking!

77
00:09:20,829 --> 00:09:21,860
Wheee!

78
00:09:22,325 --> 00:09:25,296
Not so good at falling, though!

79
00:10:03,039 --> 00:10:04,924
Oh! Stop, Mokku!

80
00:10:04,948 --> 00:10:08,114
If you wake him suddenly,
you'll scare Grandpa to death!

81
00:10:10,901 --> 00:10:11,901
H-Hey! Stop it!

82
00:10:12,049 --> 00:10:14,320
You are a useless fool!

83
00:10:14,352 --> 00:10:15,477
You're so loud!

84
00:10:19,580 --> 00:10:22,265
Listen! Stop it! Stop it!
I told you to stop! Hey!

85
00:10:29,839 --> 00:10:32,009
I'm dead.

86
00:10:34,799 --> 00:10:35,799
Grandpa!

87
00:10:37,539 --> 00:10:38,648
Grandpa!

88
00:10:41,580 --> 00:10:42,807
Wake up!

89
00:10:49,560 --> 00:10:51,825
W-What is this? What's going on?

90
00:10:57,069 --> 00:10:59,600
The wood...
The wooden puppet is right here.

91
00:10:59,710 --> 00:11:01,529
No, that's impossible...

92
00:11:02,530 --> 00:11:04,572
 I must be dreaming.

93
00:11:05,020 --> 00:11:06,105
Ouch!

94
00:11:06,313 --> 00:11:08,196
The pain must be part of the dream too.

95
00:11:08,559 --> 00:11:10,740
This hurts a bit too much, though.

96
00:11:13,979 --> 00:11:17,996
This isn't a dream,
it's real! I can hear a voice.

97
00:11:18,193 --> 00:11:19,193
Mokku.

98
00:11:19,484 --> 00:11:20,984
What is it, Grandpa?

99
00:11:22,480 --> 00:11:24,213
Mokku answered me!

100
00:11:24,525 --> 00:11:28,185
God has answered my prayers.

101
00:11:29,925 --> 00:11:32,127
You are my darling grandchild.

102
00:11:32,460 --> 00:11:33,569
Come here, Mokku.

103
00:11:35,429 --> 00:11:37,977
I'm not lonely at all anymore.

104
00:11:38,001 --> 00:11:41,402
 You're not just a puppet
 who sits there silently.

105
00:11:41,808 --> 00:11:46,969
You're a living puppet who can
talk with me and even go on walks.

106
00:11:48,419 --> 00:11:51,163
I'm so happy, Mokku.

107
00:11:55,024 --> 00:11:57,377
H-H-H-Hey! That hurts!

108
00:11:57,485 --> 00:12:01,080
Why, you little rascal! Ouch!

109
00:12:01,136 --> 00:12:02,331
Grandpa!

110
00:12:04,672 --> 00:12:05,882
Grandpa.

111
00:12:11,255 --> 00:12:15,144
Mokku, Mokku, my sweet grandchild.

112
00:12:39,870 --> 00:12:41,287
Hey, Mokku.

113
00:12:42,006 --> 00:12:44,902
Wake up. I bought you some clothes. Look!

114
00:12:44,940 --> 00:12:45,940
Clothes?

115
00:12:49,935 --> 00:12:51,245
Ah, hold on!

116
00:12:58,309 --> 00:13:01,240
Mmm, not bad at all! It suits you nicely.

117
00:13:02,554 --> 00:13:04,050
Come on now, let's put on the pants.

118
00:13:06,472 --> 00:13:07,472
What's wrong?

119
00:13:08,553 --> 00:13:12,040
What? Oh, I sold my overcoat,
so this cold is just...

120
00:13:14,466 --> 00:13:15,466
I'm fine, really.

121
00:13:16,409 --> 00:13:18,815
Come here now. Put these on.

122
00:13:18,839 --> 00:13:20,380
Go on, try them on.

123
00:13:21,220 --> 00:13:22,510
I love you, Grandpa!

124
00:13:23,044 --> 00:13:24,782
Thank you, Mokku.

125
00:13:28,619 --> 00:13:30,071
Good morning, Grandpa!

126
00:13:30,096 --> 00:13:31,580
We're here to celebrate!

127
00:13:33,000 --> 00:13:37,522
Look, your friends are here.
I invited them when I went shopping.

128
00:13:37,639 --> 00:13:39,029
Real human children!

129
00:13:39,780 --> 00:13:42,639
They've come to celebrate your birthday.

130
00:13:43,053 --> 00:13:44,192
Come on in!

131
00:13:44,835 --> 00:13:47,044
Come on, wait back here.

132
00:13:48,239 --> 00:13:50,248
Grandpa, where is this Mokku kid?

133
00:13:50,490 --> 00:13:51,863
We came to celebrate!

134
00:14:00,769 --> 00:14:02,840
Come on out, Mokku.

135
00:14:10,299 --> 00:14:11,299
It's a wooden puppet!

136
00:14:12,509 --> 00:14:13,820
The puppet is walking!

137
00:14:19,959 --> 00:14:21,498
It's made so well!

138
00:14:22,980 --> 00:14:24,929
He's a wooden puppet.

139
00:14:25,599 --> 00:14:29,052
How cute. I love puppets!

140
00:14:32,520 --> 00:14:34,795
Play nicely together, everyone.

141
00:14:34,905 --> 00:14:37,620
 I'll go find us something good to eat.

142
00:14:40,855 --> 00:14:43,760
Now, now. Stay and play
with everyone, all right?

143
00:14:49,735 --> 00:14:50,861
I see.

144
00:14:51,448 --> 00:14:53,161
This guy's made of candy wood.

145
00:14:54,065 --> 00:14:55,065


146
00:14:56,969 --> 00:14:58,600
You've done it now, you little puppet!

147
00:14:58,601 --> 00:14:59,601
No, stop!

148
00:15:00,174 --> 00:15:01,370


149
00:15:03,040 --> 00:15:06,380
You can copy humans all you want,
but you're pure wood straight to the brain!

150
00:15:06,745 --> 00:15:07,745
Mokku!

151
00:15:09,669 --> 00:15:11,420
Here, this is a present from me!

152
00:15:13,539 --> 00:15:16,229
That flower smells wonderful!

153
00:15:18,845 --> 00:15:19,883
Right?

154
00:15:22,979 --> 00:15:25,172
Fat chance! He's a wooden puppet!

155
00:15:28,199 --> 00:15:30,392
- He can't smell a thing.
- Poor guy.

156
00:15:30,729 --> 00:15:32,380
Here, this is my present.

157
00:15:43,640 --> 00:15:44,635
Hot!

158
00:15:44,660 --> 00:15:46,405
Franco, are you all right?

159
00:15:54,119 --> 00:15:55,418
Doesn't that burn?

160
00:16:01,413 --> 00:16:02,545
Stop it!

161
00:16:11,869 --> 00:16:14,550
Mokku, are you okay? Doesn't it hurt?

162
00:16:20,815 --> 00:16:21,815


163
00:16:49,099 --> 00:16:50,491
Oh, Mokku!

164
00:16:51,135 --> 00:16:53,640
Poor thing, I'll fix you right up.

165
00:16:55,549 --> 00:17:00,426
It can't be helped. You are
a wooden puppet, after all.

166
00:17:04,239 --> 00:17:06,525
There, a brand-new nose.

167
00:17:07,143 --> 00:17:08,580
Look, it's on!

168
00:17:08,604 --> 00:17:11,387
Wow, puppets sure are handy.

169
00:17:11,649 --> 00:17:13,277
There, try standing up.

170
00:17:21,139 --> 00:17:22,295
Thank goodness.

171
00:17:23,449 --> 00:17:26,009
Mokku, I'll buy you books and a bag.

172
00:17:26,034 --> 00:17:28,745
Starting tomorrow, you'll go
to school with everyone else.

173
00:18:05,163 --> 00:18:06,350
Hey, Mokku!

174
00:18:07,629 --> 00:18:11,904
Mokku, this is awesome!
It's way more fun than school!

175
00:18:12,420 --> 00:18:13,420
I want to see!

176
00:18:13,564 --> 00:18:15,316
All right! Then cough up the admission fee!

177
00:18:16,040 --> 00:18:17,446
Admission fee?

178
00:18:17,889 --> 00:18:19,210
Money, idiot!

179
00:18:19,800 --> 00:18:20,987
Money?

180
00:18:27,430 --> 00:18:29,770
The second-hand shop...
this must be the place.

181
00:18:32,549 --> 00:18:33,891
Hey, Mokku!

182
00:18:38,665 --> 00:18:39,916
You're the Cricket!

183
00:18:40,073 --> 00:18:42,880
That's right. I'm the ghost
of the cricket you killed.

184
00:18:43,519 --> 00:18:44,248
Mokku...

185
00:18:44,273 --> 00:18:47,590
...you're planning to sell your bag and
books to see the puppet show, aren't you?

186
00:18:49,184 --> 00:18:52,403
The old man even sold his coat to
buy you that bag and those books!

187
00:18:53,369 --> 00:18:55,240
But I really want to see it...

188
00:18:55,934 --> 00:18:57,541
Hmph! You ungrateful brat!

189
00:18:57,791 --> 00:19:00,341
Do something that rotten and
you'll get what's coming to you!

190
00:19:00,534 --> 00:19:01,534
Mind your own business!

191
00:19:02,449 --> 00:19:04,240
Oh, he vanished...

192
00:19:04,954 --> 00:19:06,766
You idiot! Are you trying to kill a ghost?!

193
00:19:07,319 --> 00:19:08,340
Shut up! You little...

194
00:19:11,759 --> 00:19:13,200
It's a puppet without strings!

195
00:19:13,280 --> 00:19:14,564
They say he can even talk!

196
00:19:14,680 --> 00:19:15,374
Yeah!

197
00:19:16,589 --> 00:19:18,097
Let's see...

198
00:19:20,049 --> 00:19:21,964
This one is really well made.

199
00:19:22,860 --> 00:19:23,860
All right, bought!

200
00:19:26,159 --> 00:19:29,860
Hey, Mokku. The boss says he'll show
you to the best seat in the house.

201
00:19:30,154 --> 00:19:31,340
Really? Thank you!

202
00:19:32,139 --> 00:19:34,000
Come on over here, Mokku.

203
00:19:41,994 --> 00:19:43,637
Oh, they're puppets just like me!

204
00:19:44,400 --> 00:19:45,388
Wrong!

205
00:19:45,413 --> 00:19:49,129
Those are useless puppets that can't
do a damn thing without my hands on them.

206
00:19:49,779 --> 00:19:52,660
But you move and talk all on your own.

207
00:19:54,424 --> 00:19:58,379
- You're gonna make me a damn fortune!
- No! I only came to watch!

208
00:19:58,844 --> 00:20:00,259
I'm not a sideshow attraction!

209
00:20:00,866 --> 00:20:01,960
Shut the hell up!

210
00:20:07,219 --> 00:20:09,440
Behave, or I'll smash you to pieces!

211
00:20:16,199 --> 00:20:17,640
What's going to happen to me?

212
00:20:17,937 --> 00:20:19,960
Once you end up here, it's all over.

213
00:20:21,049 --> 00:20:23,320
You'll be put on display
until the day you die.

214
00:20:24,639 --> 00:20:26,640
Just take a look inside that box.

215
00:20:35,229 --> 00:20:36,720
How horrible...

216
00:20:37,019 --> 00:20:38,042
Nothing we can do.

217
00:20:38,277 --> 00:20:41,740
Puppets can only move the
way humans want them to.

218
00:20:42,289 --> 00:20:44,360
Puppets are just playthings for humans.

219
00:20:46,257 --> 00:20:49,120
Time to get this show started...

220
00:20:57,652 --> 00:20:58,652
What the hell?

221
00:20:59,646 --> 00:21:01,960
Broke before you did a damn bit of work!

222
00:21:07,547 --> 00:21:09,158
Watch what I do to you!

223
00:21:13,429 --> 00:21:14,536
Take this!

224
00:21:21,304 --> 00:21:24,501
- How could he do something so awful...
- What the?!

225
00:21:28,419 --> 00:21:29,419
Come on, move!

226
00:21:32,069 --> 00:21:34,933
You're on. Get walking!

227
00:21:43,146 --> 00:21:44,721
Step right up, ladies and gentlemen!

228
00:21:44,745 --> 00:21:46,773
Behold the wondrous wooden puppet...

229
00:21:46,797 --> 00:21:51,835
...that moves without a soul
touching it, and even sings...

230
00:21:53,894 --> 00:21:55,500
Show 'em what you've got!

231
00:21:56,514 --> 00:21:58,540
You idiot! Do it properly!

232
00:22:02,960 --> 00:22:06,570
You idiot! Put on a smile
and greet them properly!

233
00:22:19,581 --> 00:22:22,960
Good grief, see? I told you so.

234
00:22:23,458 --> 00:22:25,864
Come on, get to work already, Mokku!

235
00:22:28,960 --> 00:22:29,960
What's the matter?

236
00:22:31,264 --> 00:22:33,278
Hey, you dim-witted slowpoke!

237
00:22:40,010 --> 00:22:41,776


238
00:22:50,819 --> 00:22:54,080
See? What did I tell you,
you ungrateful brat?!

239
00:22:55,524 --> 00:22:59,640
Puppets are just toys for humans.

240
00:23:09,996 --> 00:23:11,426
I hate being a puppet...

241
00:23:11,950 --> 00:23:13,288
I want to be human...

242
00:23:13,589 --> 00:23:14,709


243
00:23:16,879 --> 00:23:18,440
I want to be human...

244
00:23:24,819 --> 00:23:29,747
I want to be human!

245
00:23:33,442 --> 00:23:37,095
<i>Mokku is made painfully aware
of the sorrow of being a puppet...</i>

246
00:23:37,346 --> 00:23:38,860
<i>...but he doesn't cry for long.</i>

247
00:23:40,334 --> 00:23:43,653
<i>"I'll work in the puppet theater
to buy Grandpa an overcoat."</i>

248
00:23:45,469 --> 00:23:50,653
<i>However, the greedy boss breaks his
promise and works Mokku to the bone.</i>

249
00:23:52,029 --> 00:23:56,740
<i>Mokku tries to escape the terrible
boss with his fellow puppets.</i>

250
00:23:57,767 --> 00:24:00,688
<i>Look forward to next week's
Kashi no Ki Mokku.</i>

251
00:24:10,733 --> 00:24:14,071
♪ Mokku, Mokku, Kashi no Ki Mokku! ♪
Mokku, Mokku, Mokku of the Oak Tree

252
00:24:14,095 --> 00:24:18,520
♪ Mokku, Mokku, Kashi no Ki Mokku! ♪
Mokku, Mokku, Mokku of the Oak Tree

253
